		{"id":"e1f133ad7c514e0c","type":"text","text":"In another room ==>","x":5920,"y":627,"width":400,"height":50},
		{"id":"4428c4c2aa902fee","type":"text","text":"Alp walked out from the bathroom into atlas and his room. \n\nAlp: Bro where is the toilet paper.\n\nAtlas: Oh it's right here by the pillow.\n\nAlp: Why the FUCK is it by the pillow.\n\nAtlas: Think fast.","x":5920,"y":977,"width":400,"height":303},
		{"id":"a1bf3c0af2b2a5a6","type":"text","text":"[S] Atlas: Throw toilet paper.","x":5920,"y":1280,"width":400,"height":50},
